ian_queen_05_46","text":"then I'm sure I'll be able to remember you, even if I've lost my memory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_47","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05_47","text":"Marian takes the Commander's hand in both of hers and brings it to her cheek.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05_48","text":"We've made so many good memories together, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05_49","text":"I don't think it's too much to hope for a miracle, especially when it's something I want so much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05_50","text":"If your determination is that unshakable,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05_51","text":"then doesn't it stop being a miracle, and becomes something that's bound to happen?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marian_queen_05_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marian_queen_05